<h1>Datenschutzerklärung / Privacy</h1>

<p>Short version: this site sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and loads nothing from third parties. There is no client-side JavaScript at all. The only data processed on a visit is what my hosting provider records in its server logs, described below.</p>

