<h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
<p>This site is hosted on GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA — a subsidiary of Microsoft Corporation.</p>
<p>When you open a page, your browser necessarily sends technical data to GitHub's servers, which GitHub records in its own logs. This typically includes:</p>
<ul>
  <li>your IP address</li>
  <li>date and time of the request</li>
  <li>the page or file requested</li>
  <li>browser type and version, and operating system</li>
  <li>the referring page, if your browser sent one</li>
</ul>
<p>This processing is unavoidable for delivering the site and serves the secure and stable operation of it. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest). I have no access to these logs, cannot query them, and do not receive them in any form — neither aggregated nor individually. Retention is determined by GitHub, not by me.</p>
<p>Because GitHub is based in the United States, this involves a transfer of personal data to a third country. GitHub is certified under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework, for which the European Commission has issued an adequacy decision, and additionally relies on Standard Contractual Clauses. Details are in <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>

<h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
<p>This site sets no cookies of any kind. It uses no analytics, no tracking pixels, no fingerprinting, no advertising, and no consent banner — because there is nothing to consent to. Nothing is written to your browser's local storage or session storage.</p>

<h2>No third-party content</h2>
<p>Every asset on this site — stylesheet, images, and fonts — is served from this domain. Fonts in particular are self-hosted, so no connection to Google Fonts or any other font CDN is made. No page embeds external scripts, iframes, videos, maps, or social media widgets. Opening a page contacts no server other than the one hosting this site.</p>

<h2>External links</h2>
<p>Posts link out to other websites. Those links transmit nothing until you click one; at that point you leave this site and the privacy policy of the destination applies. I have no influence over how those operators handle your data.</p>

<h2>Contacting me</h2>
<p>If you email me, the content of your message and your email address are processed for the sole purpose of handling your enquiry, on the basis of Art. 6(1)(b) or Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. I do not pass this on, and I delete correspondence once it is no longer needed and no retention obligation applies.</p>
<p>Note that my contact address is a Gmail account, so email you send me is processed by Google. If that matters to you, encrypt your message or use a different channel.</p>

<h2>RSS feed</h2>
<p>Fetching <a href="/feed.xml">/feed.xml</a> is an ordinary request to this site and is covered by the server logs section above. I do not operate a mailing list and collect no subscriber data.</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>Under the GDPR you have the right to access (Art. 15), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17), restriction of processing (Art. 18), data portability (Art. 20), and to object to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21). Where processing rests on consent, you may withdraw it at any time with effect for the future.</p>
<p>In practice I hold no data about visitors, so for anything relating to server logs you will need to address GitHub directly. For email correspondence, write to the address above.</p>
<p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority. The competent one for me is the <a href="https://www.datenschutz-berlin.de/">Berliner Beauftragte für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit</a>.</p>

<h2>No automated decision-making</h2>
<p>No automated decision-making or profiling within the meaning of Art. 22 GDPR takes place.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If the site changes in a way that affects this notice, I will update it here. The revision history is public in the <a href="https://github.com/giuseppeminnella/giuseppe.dev">repository</a> for this site.</p>
